{"words": [{"text": "وَمَثَلُ", "translation": "And (the) example"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(of) those who"}, {"text": "يُنفِقُونَ", "translation": "spend"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰلَهُمُ", "translation": "their wealth"}, {"text": "ٱبْتِغَآءَ", "translation": "seeking"}, {"text": "مَرْضَاتِ", "translation": "(the) pleasure"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَتَثْبِيتًۭا", "translation": "and certainty"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَنفُسِهِمْ", "translation": "their (inner) souls"}, {"text": "كَمَثَلِ", "translation": "(is) like"}, {"text": "جَنَّةٍۭ", "translation": "a garden"}, {"text": "بِرَبْوَةٍ", "translation": "on a height"}, {"text": "أَصَابَهَا", "translation": "fell on it"}, {"text": "وَابِلٌۭ", "translation": "heavy rain"}, {"text": "فَـَٔاتَتْ", "translation": "so it yielded"}, {"text": "أُكُلَهَا", "translation": "its harvest"}, {"text": "ضِعْفَيْنِ", "translation": "double"}, {"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "(does) not"}, {"text": "يُصِبْهَا", "translation": "fall (on) it"}, {"text": "وَابِلٌۭ", "translation": "heavy rain"}, {"text": "فَطَلٌّۭ ۗ", "translation": "then a drizzle"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "you do"}, {"text": "بَصِيرٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Seer"}], "sahih": "And the example of those who spend their wealth seeking means to the approval of Allāh and assuring [reward for] themselves is like a garden on high ground which is hit by a downpour - so it yields its fruits in double. And [even] if it is not hit by a downpour, then a drizzle [is sufficient]. And Allāh, of what you do, is Seeing."}